  "description": "T1 - Extra-Large Ash- Undertake a crown reduction of approximately 2-2.5 metres in height and 2.5-3 metres in lateral spread, pruning back to suitable secondary growth points or appropriate branch unions, as dictated by the existing crown structure.  The reduction shall be carried out progressively throughout the crown to maintain a balanced, naturally furnished canopy, preserve the tree's structural integrity and avoid unnecessary removal of live growth. \r\rAs an Arboricultural Association Approved Contractor (AC2626), Treehab Ltd. will undertake all works in accordance with BS 39982010 - Tree work Recommendations.\r\rReason for work: General tree maintenance",
